Hi

after 10 months one of my Maxtor 160Gb disk started to report a lot of
badblocks. originaly this disk was attached to the integrated promise sata
tx2 controller and in this configuration the machine just lock after some
badblocks (no oops, no ping, just a dead machine). 
attaching this disk to the piix (ata_piix) and running badblocks survive for
3/4 days
I tried several times with promise controller and 1 time with piix with the
same result
I have to change this disk soon so i can run test for this week only

tested with kernel 2.6.8.1 from debian, 2.6.9 and 2.6.10-rc1-bk20 +
